{"id":"vod_sn_36287","vodId":"36287","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"钢琴之森第一季","name_cn":"钢琴之森第一季","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/6fa0e9a1d6351ff588fa309d819cd21b.jpg"},"summary":"一之濑海（齐藤壮马 配音）自幼就非常热爱钢琴这门乐器，是公认的天才钢琴少年。一次偶然中，海在森林里发现了一架废弃的钢琴，只有海能够通过这架钢琴演奏出美妙的音乐。这架特殊的钢琴锻炼了海的演奏技巧，让他获得了和常人比更多的经验。　　阿字野壮介（诹访部顺一 配音）曾经也是一名天才钢琴师，然而，一场意外的车祸让他不得不告别了自己的职业生涯，对过去耿耿于怀的壮介成为了海的叔父，将自己未能完成的期望寄托在了他的身上。雨宫修平（花江夏树 配音）是海宿命般的对手，两人亦敌亦友，互相竞争，齐头并进。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cLvLbaBDRe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ppGwQYYgTc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8b6wcPVJNu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V4xf3UWmGQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SAjYXX2e5N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nmKZuUkeBt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HnW5fFa55K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r49pAmFwYb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VywNTi32Y81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gqYqq8RchD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f5Zgx47qBK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G44mvGfZgH1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:24.768Z"}